		{
			dependencies: ["479D4A1C7A61B97C"]
			description: [
				"Eldermoor's tech tree has four pillars, and you can tackle them in any order:"
				""
				"&aCreate&f - rotation, belts and contraptions (see the &aCreate&f chapter)."
				"&6Immersive Engineering&f - chunky multiblocks, wires and diesel."
				"&bMekanism&f - ore multiplication, chemicals, reactors and the MekaSuit."
				"&dApplied Energistics 2&f - digital storage and auto-crafting."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Almost all of it runs on &cForge Energy (FE)&f. Every mod's cables and machines accept each other's power, so mix freely."
				""
				"This short chapter shows how to turn Create's rotation into FE - the cheapest way to power your first machines."
			]
